                                    </h4>
                                    <ul class="list-unstyled mt-2">
                                        <li class="mb-2" style="font-size: 18px;">
                                            <i class="fa fa-check text-success"></i>
                                            Provide emotional, academic, and career guidance.
                                        </li>
                                        <li class="mb-2" style="font-size: 18px;">
                                            <i class="fa fa-check text-success"></i>
                                            Maintain confidentiality and ethical standards.
                                        </li>
                                        <li class="mb-2" style="font-size: 18px;">
                                            <i class="fa fa-check text-success"></i>
                                            Encourage discipline, values, and holistic development.
                                        </li>
                                        <li style="font-size: 18px;">
                                            <i class="fa fa-check text-success"></i>
                                            Keep accurate mentoring records and follow-ups.
                                        </li>
                                    </ul>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <!-- DON'Ts -->
                            <div class="col-md-6">
                                <div class="alert alert-danger shadow-sm">
                                    <h4 class="text-danger">
                                        <i class="fa fa-times-circle"></i> DON’Ts FOR MENTORS
                                    </h4>
                                    <ul class="list-unstyled mt-2">
                                        <li class="mb-2" style="font-size: 18px;">
                                            <i class="fa fa-times text-danger"></i>
                                            Avoid bias, favouritism, or personal interference.
                                        </li>
                                        <li class="mb-2" style="font-size: 18px;">
                                            <i class="fa fa-times text-danger"></i>
                                            Do not breach confidentiality or professional boundaries.
                                        </li>
                                        <li class="mb-2" style="font-size: 18px;">
                                            <i class="fa fa-times text-danger"></i>
                                            Do not neglect students requiring special attention.
                                        </li>
                                        <li style="font-size: 18px;">
                                            <i class="fa fa-times text-danger"></i>
                                            Do not treat mentoring as a mere administrative formality.
                                        </li>
                                    </ul>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>


